        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Etching - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HF (Hydrofluoric acid):\n  Etches SiO₂ rapidly: SiO₂ + 6HF → H₂SiF₆ + 2H₂O\n  Selectivity: SiO₂ >> Si, Si₃N₄ (SiO₂:Si selectivity ~1000:1)\n  BHF (Buffered HF = NH₄F + HF): controlled etch rate, prevents pH drift\n  Applications: oxide strip, pre-gate clean, STI recess, contact etch (assisted)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ETCHING.md#011",
      "path": [
        "04-ETCHING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:semiconductor-manufacturing:04-etching, git-history:semiconductor-manufacturing:04-etching]",
        "canonical_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/04-ETCHING.md",
        "concepts": "[etching]",
        "current_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/04-ETCHING.md",
        "id": "maxim:semiconductor-manufacturing:etching",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[etching]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Etching - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "H₃PO₄ (Phosphoric acid, 85%, 160°C):\n  Etches Si₃N₄ selectively over SiO₂ (selectivity ~35:1 at 160°C)\n  Used for: nitride spacer wet strip during GAA nanosheet release"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ETCHING.md#012",
