      "text": "SC1 (Standard Clean 1: NH₄OH + H₂O₂ + H₂O):\n  Removes particles and organic contamination\n  Slightly etches SiO₂ (helps lift particles)\n  SC2 (HCl + H₂O₂ + H₂O): removes metals"
    },
